## Status legend

- **M1** = gate + proposals (Short) — the airlock
- **M1g** = `group` field + grouped review + group revert (Short, builds on M1)
- **M1i** = impact registry — LSP-backed impact requirement on shared-code proposals (Short, builds on M1g)
- **M2** = prefs (Quick)
- **M3** = snapshots + journal (Medium) — the safety net
- **M4** = knowledge + session search (Medium)
- **Stretch** = tags, skills, control panel (Large)
